person.note:
U.S. Ambassador to Haiti from December 19, 1973, until July 8, 1977;
                    Coordinator for Combating Terrorism from October 26, 1977, until August 1,
                    1978

Deputy Assistant Secretary of State for Inter-American Affairs until 1977;
                    Deputy Assistant Secretary of State for European Affairs from 1977 until 1978;
                    U.S. Ambassador to Venezuela from October 9, 1978

U.S. Ambassador to Venezuela from June 16, 1976, until June 24, 1978;
                    Assistant Secretary of State for Western Hemisphere Affairs from July 18, 1978,
                    until November 30, 1979
